WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.479
Should the client buy this company?

2
00:00:02.629 --> 00:00:07.515
Use it when: A company buying another company (mergers and acquisitions).

3
00:00:07.565 --> 00:00:12.780
Ask first: Why buy: growth, capabilities, cost savings or a new market?

4
00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:19.009
Is the target good on its own? Its market, its performance vs peers and standalone value.

5
00:00:19.059 --> 00:00:25.322
What extra is it worth to us? Revenue synergies, cost synergies and minus integration costs.

6
00:00:25.372 --> 00:00:31.767
Can we make it work? Funding the deal, integration and culture and regulation (competition law).

7
00:00:31.817 --> 00:00:35.857
Is the price right? Price vs value to us and alternatives.

8
00:00:35.907 --> 00:00:44.649
Buy only if standalone value + synergies − integration costs is more than the price, and buying beats building it yourself.
